{"id":"430331","name":"肉末海参蕃茄汤","author":"老U爱小轩哥","authorId":"5899877","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/430331/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"瘦肉","amount":"半斤"},{"name":"即食海参","amount":"3颗"},{"name":"蕃茄","amount":"1颗"}],"sub":[{"name":"胡椒粉","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"材料如下。","img":"images/430331/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"瘦肉剁成末。","img":"images/430331/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"加入矿泉水混合均匀，静泡半小时。","img":"images/430331/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"蕃茄加热水浸泡去皮。","img":"images/430331/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"切块备用。","img":"images/430331/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"将海参姜片放入，开大火烧开。","img":"images/430331/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"水开后加入番茄。","img":"images/430331/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"煮20分钟调味即可。","img":"images/430331/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"蕃茄可解腥味，如没有可加番茄酱。","img":"images/430331/step_9.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：砂锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}